onante e personalizada.</p>		\n															<img width=\"86\" height=\"86\" src=\"http://localhost/jornadaviagens/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Avatar-Lauro.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n			<h2>Lauro B. Matos</h2>		\n						<i>&#9733;</i><i>&#9733;</i><i>&#9733;</i><i>&#9733;</i><i>&#9733;</i> 5/5', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '46-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-04-25 15:13:28', '2023-04-25 18:13:28', '', 46, 'http://localhost/jornadaviagens/?p=168', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
